Guessing Game Pseudocode

Initialize Random Number Generator
Initialize totalGuesses Variable at 7
Initialize userGusess Variable
Initialize randomNumber Variable
Initialize isGuessed Boolean at False
Initialize exitGame Boolean at False

WHILE exitGame is False, Loop this:
    WHILE totalGusesses < 7 Loop this,
        Prompt guess from the user
        User guesses a number
        Add 1 to totalGuesses
        IF userGusess is = randomNumber
            Set totalGusesses to 7
            Set isGuessed to True
        ELSE IF userGusess > randomNumber
            Display "Too High, Try again" Message
        ELSE
            Disply "Too Low, Try again" Message
    End of WHILE Loop - For totalGusses
    IF isGuessed is True
        Display Winning Message
    ELSE
        Display Loosing Message
    Prompt user to Play Again 
    IF NO
        Display See You Next Time Message
        Set exitGame to True
    ELSE
        Display Good Luck Message
End of While Loop - For exitGame

    
